    "title": "JEI Integration: Reborn",
    "description": "Added more information tips for items.",
    "body": "# Welcome use the JEI Integration Reborn Mod\n\nThis mod brings [JEI Integration](https://modrinth.com/mod/jei-integration) functionality to newer versions of Minecraft.\n\n## After you have installed the mod and configured it correctly, your items will display:\n\n1.  burn time\n2.  durability\n3.  maximum stack size\n4.  tags\n5.  data components\n6.  translation key\n7.  enchantability\n8.  hunger/saturation\n\n## Configuration Notice:\n\n⚠️ All features are disabled by default You must edit the config file to activate desired functionality. This allows precise control over your JEI interface and prevents information overload.",
